Description: Provides tools to generate, visualize, and audit geometric
    string art figures for mathematics teaching. The package includes functions
    for circular, cardioid-like, elliptical, triangular, polygonal, star,
    parabolic, net-based, radial, hexagonal, lotus-like, rose-like, spiral,
    Lissajous, grid-based, decimal, and contour-based string art patterns.
    Each function returns peg coordinates, connection tables, total string
    length, audit information, and metadata, supporting educational
    applications in geometry, analytic geometry, modular arithmetic,
    trigonometry, rational numbers, and visual mathematics.
